extent permissible by applicable law, for any use or purpose, anywhere
in the world, including without limitation commercial, advertising or
promotional purposes (the "Waiver"). The Affirmer makes the Waiver for
the benefit of each member of the public at large and to the detriment
of the Affirmer's heirs and successors, fully intending that such Waiver
