Note on third-party data and assets
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The Creative Commons CC0 1.0 dedication above applies only to the code
and documentation authored in this repository. It does **not** apply to:

* Drone / UAS zone data published by the Bulgarian Civil Aviation
  Authority (ГД ГВА) at https://www.caa.bg/ — that data remains subject
  to whatever licence ГД ГВА publishes it under.
* BGMountains tiles (https://bgmountains.org/) — CC-BY-NC-SA 2.5; the
  default basemap in this project. Forks planning a commercial build
  should swap this layer out.
* OpenTopoMap tiles (https://opentopomap.org/) — CC-BY-SA.
* OpenStreetMap tiles (https://www.openstreetmap.org/) — ODbL.
* Leaflet (https://leafletjs.com/) — BSD-2.

Forks and downstream users must comply with each upstream project's
licence terms independently of this dedication.